# Local audit/scratch: QA extractions of the portable build, patch backups,
# logo concepts. The committed tree is the source of truth; nothing here is
# needed to build, and it contains copies of shipped binaries.
.work/

# Test scratch roots. The suites write their fixtures into the system temp
# directory when the process may write there, and into .nftest/ when it may
# not (a sandboxed CI, a machine under an application-control policy).
# .nf_scratch/ is the same idea for a running process: the editor's import
# validation writes a temporary copy of a scene it is checking.
.nftest/
.nf_scratch/

# Development screenshots: 6.9 MB of working captures (two 2.6 MB BMPs
# included) that were being tracked alongside the curated ones. The curated
# screenshots live in Docs/images/ and website/assets/screenshots/; these are
# the scratch copies and are not part of the documentation.
shots/

